{"sha":"6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTfjBAtoAKDZhZTY5ZjU3ZmE5ZDY3NWI1MDNmNWU2MzExNDA2NDRlNjUyNzI0YWI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ryan Newton","email":"rrnewton@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-17T08:42:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"Ryan Newton","email":"ryan.newton@alum.mit.edu","date":"2026-09-17T08:47:19Z"},"message":"Use supported GNU TLS for on-demand DBT clients\n\n[hermit2, degraded-unresolved, gpt-6-astra, devbig014, role=impl]\n\nPlain Language Summary and Project Impact\n\nThe on-demand native-client build omitted the GNU TLS option already used\nby Hermit's installed client. Pinned GCC 15.3 emits x86 TLS descriptors by\ndefault, but DynamoRIO's private x86 descriptor resolver returns zero.\nApply the same GNU-only target option so this producer uses supported TLS.\n\nSummary\n\nOnly reverie-dbt/native/CMakeLists.txt changes. Client code, depth\nassertions, C/Rust ABI, original tests and execution bounds are unchanged.\n\nValidation\n\nBuilt both original and corrected actual native targets in the original\npinned image with identical source, retained DynamoRIO and Rust runtime\ninputs. Original ELF has one R_X86_64_TLSDESC relocation; corrected ELF has\nnone and uses GNU TLS with __tls_get_addr. Both builds and ELF controls\npassed in a 6.005-second bounded scope; source/input readbacks unchanged.\nThese are compiler/relocation controls, not a Hermit guest or original\nlibrary-unit pass. Historical exec-time on-demand DSO identity was not\nretained. Downstream original-unit validation follows actual pin adoption.\n\nDeterminism\n\nNo random, scheduling, accounting, evidence or comparison policy changes.\nThis aligns the native producer with the loader's supported TLS ABI.\n\nLinux Semantics\n\nNo guest syscall, thread lifecycle, error, or output semantics are changed.\nThe callback-depth assertions remain mandatory.","tree":{"sha":"e622a61c7644ab2b7e12debc4d6b236cb8048675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/reverie/git/trees/e622a61c7644ab2b7e12debc4d6b236cb8048675"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/reverie/git/commits/6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/reverie/commits/6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/reverie/commit/6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/reverie/commits/6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab/comments","author":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c164a0854f5782d5c5d4548f532ffb55dd16e8bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/reverie/commits/c164a0854f5782d5c5d4548f532ffb55dd16e8bc","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/reverie/commit/c164a0854f5782d5c5d4548f532ffb55dd16e8bc"}],"stats":{"total":6,"additions":6,"deletions":0},"files":[{"sha":"bcfb298a4f87ed190d7fdc52393e01d1245a8fe3","filename":"reverie-dbt/native/CMakeLists.txt","status":"modified","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changes":6,"blob_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/reverie/blob/6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab/reverie-dbt%2Fnative%2FCMakeLists.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/reverie/raw/6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab/reverie-dbt%2Fnative%2FCMakeLists.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/reverie/contents/reverie-dbt%2Fnative%2FCMakeLists.txt?ref=6ae69f57fa9d675b503f5e631140644e652724ab","patch":"@@ -12,6 +12,12 @@ endif()\n \n add_library(reverie_dbt_client SHARED client.c)\n configure_DynamoRIO_client(reverie_dbt_client)\n+\n+# DynamoRIO's private x86 loader does not implement R_X86_64_TLSDESC.\n+# Match Hermit's installed-client producer when GNU defaults to GNU2 TLS.\n+if(CMAKE_C_COMPILER_ID STREQUAL \"GNU\")\n+  target_compile_options(reverie_dbt_client PRIVATE -mtls-dialect=gnu)\n+endif()\n use_DynamoRIO_extension(reverie_dbt_client drmgr)\n use_DynamoRIO_extension(reverie_dbt_client drreg)\n use_DynamoRIO_extension(reverie_dbt_client drx)"}]}